OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcycle and van collision
OL,4,Acloses dual carriageway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collision between a motorcycle and a
OL,7,Fvan has closed an Oxfordshire dual
OL,8,Fcarriageway.
OL,10,FNational Highways said the "serious"
OL,11,Fincident A34 was closed in both
OL,12,Fdirections between the A4185 for
OL,13,FChilton and the A4130 for Didcot.
OL,15,FIt said emergency services, including
OL,16,FThames Valley Police and Thames Valley
OL,17,FAir Ambulance, were in attendance, as
OL,18,Fwell as traffic officers assisting with
OL,19,Ftraffic management.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
